# BEGIN DA_BLOCK merge_notes
# Dwarven Knowledge: this is Anbennar's topbar.gui plus the mod's additions.
# Every addition is between "# BEGIN DA_BLOCK <name>" and "# END DA_BLOCK <name>"; a changed Anbennar line
# ends with "# DA_PATCH <name> (Anbennar: <original>)"; "ANB_AHEAD" blocks come from a newer Anbennar.
# Without the blocks and patches the file is Anbennar's, byte for byte. Keep it that way:
#   - new Dwarven Knowledge windows go inside the block "windows";
#   - do not edit Anbennar's lines; if you must, mark the line with DA_PATCH;
#   - do not move blocks: element order is drawing order.
# To update Anbennar: python3 "Claude files/tools/merge_topbar.py" merge . <new anbennar folder>
# END DA_BLOCK merge_notes
#####################################################################
# To avoid errors, avoid allowing scripted instantTextBoxType and	#
# iconType elements interact with the mouse. topbar.gui is bugged	#
# and will throw errors on mouseover.								#
# Use alwaystransparent = yes to prevent this.						#
# For iconType elements, tooltips can be defined in this file.		#
#####################################################################

### Constant values - EU4 converts @word to the specified value
#Magic school icon frames
@abjuration_icon = 1
@conjuration_icon = 2
@divination_icon = 3
@enchantment_icon = 4
@evocation_icon = 5
@illusion_icon = 6
